# Files not needed to serve the learner app, excluded from the Vercel upload.
#
# The browser app loads ONLY:
#   - index.html
#   - learner/**            (index.html, style.css, the JS modules, data.js, chunks/*.json, favicon.svg)
#   - assessor/feedback/<item-id>.json   (per-item feedback, fetched only after an attempt)
#   - assessor/calibration/<item-id>.json(per-item calibration, fetched only from Assessor mode)
# plus the Markdown text curriculum linked from the pages.
#
# The aggregate answer/benchmark files are excluded so a deployed static site
# never serves every reference solution in one request — matching the product
# rule that answers must not be reachable before an attempt (see
# validate_adaptive.py "exposed solution" checks). They remain in git for
# maintainers and CI.

assessor/answers.json
assessor/benchmarks.json

# Maintainer-only source, tests and CI config are not part of the served site.
scripts/
tests/
.github/
.github/**
node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
playwright.config.js
package-lock.json